---
permalink: /contact/
title: Contact ArcadeWorld
description: Get in touch with ArcadeWorld — suggest a game, report an issue, or reach the editors.
---
{% extends 'base.njk' %}

{% block adsense %}{% endblock %}
{# No AdSense on this page (issue #15). #}

{% block content %}
<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">

    <nav class="text-sm text-paper-60 mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-paper">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-paper">Contact</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6">Contact</h1>

    <div class="text-paper-70 leading-relaxed space-y-5 text-lg">
        <p>
            Found a great browser game we should list? Spot an error in a listing, a dead source link,
            or a licence we got wrong? We want to hear about it.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="surface rounded-xl p-6 mt-8 space-y-4 text-paper-70">
        <div>
            <h2 class="font-semibold text-paper"><a href="/submit/" class="link-inline">Submit a game</a></h2>
            <p class="text-sm mt-1 text-paper-60">Include the game name, the author's official URL, and the licence if known. We only list games with a verifiable source.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="font-semibold text-paper">Report an issue</h2>
            <p class="text-sm mt-1 text-paper-60">Inaccurate description, broken outbound link, or attribution error — tell us which game page and what is wrong.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="font-semibold text-paper">Author takedown</h2>
            <p class="text-sm mt-1 text-paper-60">If you are the author of a listed game and want it removed, contact us and we will delist it promptly.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-paper-60 text-sm mt-8">
        Reach the editors at: <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>
    </p>

</div>
{% endblock %}
